   "id": "Finset.addEnergy'",
   "generated_kind": null,
   "external": false,
   "docstring":
   "The additive energy `E[s, t]` of two finsets `s` and `t` in a group is the number of quadruples\n`(a₁, a₂, b₁, b₂) ∈ s × s × t × t` such that `a₁ + b₁ = a₂ + b₂`.\n\nThe notation `E[s, t]` is available in scope `Combinatorics.Additive`. "},
  {"value": null,
   "type":
